    36	
    37	> **ADE-DECORATED-THREAT.**
    38	>
    39	> 1. A connected exceptional Dynkin type embedded in (0.2) is necessarily
    40	>    `A_r` with `1<=r<=8` or `D_r` with `4<=r<=9`.  Types `A9,E6,E7,E8`
    41	>    are impossible already in the `D9` root coordinates.  This is stronger
