    47	>    different properly (as a projectively finite `pi` permits), then
    48	>    `1<=sum n_i<=8`; if the `B`-fibre through the point also meets the
    49	>    different properly, the sharper bound is `sum n_i<=4`.  Hence these
    50	>    explicitly proper-intersection strata are literal finite sets.
